</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00127/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个SCP基金会的Logo，任何看见它的人都会重复“收容，控制，保护”<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>[已编辑]<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>Site05的大厅<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>王特工：“收容，控制，保护。”<br />
Dr.Bert：“你已经念了这玩意45遍了&#8230;&#8230;..哦，收容，控制，保护。”</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00127" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00127" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00127-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crimaster" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6106971); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6106971&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610051929" alt="Crimaster" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6106971)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crimaster" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6106971); return false;">Crimaster</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588080081 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Apr 2020 13:21</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00398/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一支原产于比利时的FN FNC突击步枪，只有在弹匣井内插有巧克力块时才能射出子弹。若插入正常弹匣，则项目只会射出5.56×45mm子弹形状的巧克力。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>武警部队特种警察大队██仓库<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-██异常武器收容单元<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>射出的巧克力吃起来特别甜。</em>——Dr. Kleiner</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00398" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00398" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00398-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5232386&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610051929" alt="Kayo_Kesr_Aquas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5232386)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;">Kayo_Kesr_Aquas</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1600577702 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 Sep 2020 04:55</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00454/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把高约0.75m的实木椅子，任何<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">人</span>生物坐在其上时均会不可避免的（以头朝下的姿势）摔倒在地。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-█，Dr.4826的办公室。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被永久保存在Site-█，Dr.4826的办公室内。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我就不信邪了，██的，我堂堂七尺男儿还坐不上去一把椅子？——Dr.4826<br />
兄弟们，你们要是想我就多来医院看看我，哎呦&#8230;我的脑袋&#8230;——Dr.4826<br />
阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴——Dr.4826</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00454" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00454" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00454-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ngc-4826" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6285237); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6285237&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610051929" alt="NGC-4826" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6285237)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ngc-4826" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6285237); return false;">NGC-4826</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1604823683 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">08 Nov 2020 08:21</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00054/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个陶瓷储蓄罐，投入其内部的任何货币均会按照当前汇率被替换为同等价值的第五套人民币。需要注意的是，尽管大部分情况下该项目替换出的货币均为硬币，但若满足某些特定条件（例如投入货币的面值超出当前第五套人民币硬币涵盖的面值且数值较大难以通过数值叠加来形成同等价值）后可促使该项目替换出纸币。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2016/█/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>青海省西宁市<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>于Site-CN-19异常项目收容处<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>对于外国游客来说应该会很有用</em>——Dr.Jackson</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00054" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00054" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00054-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4546338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610051929" alt="miku1314" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4546338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;">miku1314</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1586496622 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">10 Apr 2020 05:30</span></p>
</div>
